# Grand Ball Guest {1}{R}, a 2/2: "Celebration — This creature gets +1/+1 and has trample as long as two or more nonland
# permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn." On turn three Bot1 plays a Mountain and casts the Guest: a
# land and one nonland permanent, so a 2/2 without trample. A Memnite entering after it is the second nonland permanent, so a 3/3
# with trample. The Mox Ruby of turn one doesn't count on turn three: the Guest is a 2/2 again at the start of turn five, where a
# Mountain and a Memnite are still one nonland permanent (2/2) and an Ornithopter is the second (3/3 trample).

